# 统一行尾：文本文件在仓库与检出时一律 LF，避免 macOS / Linux / Windows 之间
# 出现整文件 diff，以及 clang-format、ruff 的噪音。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 显式声明（可读性；与上面的默认行为一致）
*.csv text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.lua text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.cmake text eol=lf
*.in text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.pyd binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
